all licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0. No vendored
fork of any of these is used.

The matchmaking.* / tracking.* PostgreSQL schema in database/init_postgres.go
is hand-authored from that library's SQL (the library expects the schema to
exist and never creates it) - see docs/matchmaking-schema.md.

The Monster Hunter 3 Ultimate NEX configuration (game server ID 10104d00,
access key cb2b2f5a, NEX 3.0.5) and every MH3U-specific wire-format quirk in
nex/ (see PROTOCOL_COVERAGE.md) is first-party reverse engineering by this
project, developed and iterated against real console traffic. No proprietary
Nintendo or Capcom code or assets are included.
